titel = "Ponygirls"
description = "Ponygirls, Whorses, She-Beasts, or Ponycunts. There are many ways to call them, but in essence, they are tall women (mostly elves or humans), who arestripped naked and forced to serve as mounts and sextoys for their goblin masters.

Ponygirls are kept mostly naked, except for hoofed ponyboots, armbinders, and a harness made of leather stripes.

A bit-gag, tailplug and often a dildo are very common additions too, and some goblins like to decorate their ponygirls with piercings or warpaint.

In the past Ponygirls were literal slaves. Kidnapped and forced into service through raids or sold on markets.

Today it's different. Goblins are allies of the empire and getting bred by strong and potent goblins is a good way to get pregnant. Besides, almost everybody knows that goblin cum is extremely healthy, can cure almost everything, and some say even it de-ages you.

On top of that, many tall-folk women have an inexplicable fascination with serving as ponycunts - though most wouldn’t openly admit it."
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://bkxhc74auednr"
